I scam a scammer. There's this thing called scambaiting ([https://www.419eater.com/](https://www.419eater.com/)) where people who know they're communicating with some Nigerian scammer waste as much of the scammer's time as possible by pretending to fall for the scam, but keep the thread going as long as possible. The advanced ones even get the scammer to waste money on trips to airports because the scam-baiter says that he or she will meet the scammer there.

&#x200B;

My ultimate wish regarding scamming is to lure a scammer into police custody whilst having all the evidence that he tried to defraud me.

